@baseUrl = http://localhost:4450
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here

### Performance Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/performance/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Performance Ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/performance/ledger?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Performance Skills
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/performance/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Performance Ratings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/performance/ratings?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
